{{!-- Custom HTML block — a "custom-html" block of the Product section
      (sections/product.schema.json), printed in the product info column where
      the other blocks go: the merchant's own HTML/CSS/JS, Shopify's "Custom
      Liquid" block. Called as {{> custom-html-block this}} with the block, so
      `settings` are the block's and {{{attributes}}} = the editor's data-block-id,
      which the root element MUST print so the editor can select the block. The
      HTML goes through applyTokens (store tokens resolve, other braces stay). --}}
{{#if settings.css}}<style>{{{settings.css}}}</style>{{/if}}
<div class="pd-custom-html" {{{attributes}}}>{{{applyTokens settings.html}}}</div>
{{#if settings.js}}<script>{{{settings.js}}}</script>{{/if}}
